          "LocalizedString": "No unnecessary side roads—just a track that completely circles around Bridge Crossings. If the scenery here has become too familiar for your liking, why not turn on some music for a different vibe?"
        },
        "LockedBackImage": {
          "AssetPathName": "/Game/UI/UI/RaceCar/saidao/UI_YH_RacingTrack_02B_Lock.UI_YH_RacingTrack_02B_Lock",
