          "LocalizedString": "Starting from Fiscus Avenue, the route goes through Crane Path, Oia Avenue, Camelot Avenue, Kino Avenue, Iris Bridge, Torchwood Avenue, and Davidia Avenue. Hit the gas and accelerate down these wide open roads!"
