          "Key": "UI_Race_Track_Desc_09",
          "SourceString": "如果有一条有颜色的公路，会是什么样的呢？也许这条路线会给你答案。春天的田野，秋天的麦田，在不同的季节来跑一跑，让不同的颜色装点你的速度吧。",
          "LocalizedString": "If roads had colors, what would they look like? Perhaps this route has the answer. Race past spring fields and autumn wheatlands, and let each season paint your ride in a different hue."
